		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<h2 class="section-title">Questions</h2>
		<p class="body-p">
			If you have questions about these terms or commercial licensing, email us directly at <a href="mailto:contact@podomy.com" class="body-link">contact@podomy.com</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
